      {{ help("The actionable per-stock shortlist — the China parallel of the US 'Standout individual stocks' card strip. REVERSAL-led after the deep-history correction: on ~35 years of A-share data, cross-sectional MOMENTUM is NOT a validated edge; short-term <b>reversal</b> is (research/CHINA_HK_STOCK_SIGNALS.md, reports/china-residual-alpha-deep.md). So this surfaces decent-quality names (some residual relative strength) sitting at a <b>cycle-confirmed mean-reversion entry</b> — a recent <b>pullback</b>, not an extended spike. Ranked by the <b>setup</b> score, which LEADS with the validated effects (the calibrated cycle entry + the pullback/reversal overlay); the residual is only a light quality tiebreaker (0.35×). The 🛡🔄 <b>safer rebound</b> chip flags a CONFLUENCE name — one that is BOTH a deep-dip reversal candidate AND a low-vol defensive name (both validated legs agree). An <b>extended</b> name is reversal RISK, not a buy. Context to size and confirm — not a buy list.", "可操作的个股精选名单 —— 美国“表现突出的个股”卡片的中国版。经深度历史校正后改为反转主导：在约35年的A股数据上，横截面动量并非有效优势；短期<b>反转</b>才是（research/CHINA_HK_STOCK_SIGNALS.md、reports/china-residual-alpha-deep.md）。因此这里筛选出具备一定残差相对强度、且处于<b>周期确认的均值回归入场点</b>（近期<b>回调</b>而非急涨过热）的优质个股。按<b>配置分</b>排序，该分以已验证的效应为主（校准的周期入场＋回调/反转叠加）；残差仅作轻量质量加权（0.35×）。🛡🔄 <b>稳健反弹</b>标记表示<b>合流</b>个股 —— 既是深跌反转候选、又是低波防御股（两条已验证支线一致）。<b>extended</b>（急涨）个股是反转风险而非买入。用于定仓与确认的背景 —— 而非买入清单。") }}
    </h2>
    <p class="note" style="margin:0 0 2px;text-transform:none">{{ t('Decent names at a cycle-confirmed mean-reversion entry — the validated A-share read, ranked by setup score (cycle entry + pullback/reversal). A research shortlist to size and confirm, not a buy list.', '处于周期确认均值回归入场点的优质个股 —— 已验证的A股解读，按配置分（周期入场＋回调/反转）排序。用于研究、定仓与确认的名单，而非买入清单。') }}</p>
    <div class="nbgrid" data-showmore="12">
    {% for n in setups.buy %}
      {% set _d = n.dir or 'caution' %}
      <a class="nbcard nb-{{ _d }}" href="china_lookup.html#{{ n.ticker }}">
