          {% if n.price is not none %}<span class="nb-px">{{ '%.2f'|format(n.price) }}</span>{% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="nb-sub"><span>{{ t(n.sector, SECZH.get(n.sector, n.sector)) }}</span>{% if n.off_high is not none %}<span>{{ '%+.1f'|format(n.off_high) }}% {{ t('off 52w high', '距52周高') }}</span>{% endif %}</div>
        {% if n.spark_svg %}{{ n.spark_svg | safe }}{% endif %}
        <div class="nb-bot">
          <span class="nb-state">{{ td(n.label or n.state) }}</span>
          {% if n.confluence %}<span class="nb-conf" title="In BOTH validated screens — a deep-dip reversal candidate that is ALSO a low-vol defensive name (a structurally safer rebound). · 同时进入两条已验证筛选 —— 既是深跌反转候选又是低波防御股（结构上更稳健的反弹）。">🛡🔄 {{ t('safer rebound', '稳健反弹') }}</span>{% endif %}
        </div>
        {% if n.alpha is not none or n.alpha_entry %}
        <div class="nb-alpha">
          {% if n.alpha is not none %}<span class="nb-az {{ 'az-up' if n.alpha>0 else ('az-dn' if n.alpha<0 else '') }}" title="Sector-neutral residual relative strength (z) — a light quality tiebreaker, not the ranking driver (A-share momentum is not validated). · 板块中性残差相对强度（z）— 轻量质量加权，非排序主导（A股动量未获验证）。">α {{ '%+.2f'|format(n.alpha) }}</span>{% endif %}
          {% if n.sector_rank %}<span class="nb-rk" title="Rank within its sector by residual relative strength · 按残差相对强度在其板块内排名">#{{ n.sector_rank }}/{{ n.sector_n }}</span>{% endif %}
          {% if n.alpha_entry == 'pullback' %}<span class="nb-ent ent-good" title="A recent pullback — the constructive mean-reversion entry · 近期回调 — 建设性的均值回归入场">{{ t('pullback', '回调') }}</span>
          {% elif n.alpha_entry == 'extended' %}<span class="nb-ent ent-warn" title="A recent spike — short-term reversal risk · 近期急涨 — 短线反转风险">{{ t('extended', '过热') }}</span>{% endif %}
        </div>
        {% endif %}
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% if setups.laggards %}
    <p class="note" style="margin:13px 0 5px;text-transform:none;color:var(--down);font-weight:700">⚠ {{ t('Weakest relative momentum (laggards) — distribution risk:', '相对动量最弱（落后股）— 派发风险：') }}</p>
    <p style="margin:0;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 0;align-items:center">
      {% for r in setups.laggards %}<a href="china_lookup.html#{{ r.ticker }}" style="margin-right:14px;white-space:nowrap"><b>{{ r.ticker }}</b> <span class="note">{{ nm(r.name) }}</span> <span class="neg">{{ '%+.2f'|format(r.alpha) }}</span></a>{% endfor %}
    </p>
    {% endif %}
    <p class="note" style="margin:8px 0 0;font-size:11px">{{ t('Cycle entry + mean-reversion (the validated A-share effects), with residual relative strength as a light quality tiebreaker. Deep-history corrected: A-shares mean-revert — momentum is not an edge. A shortlist to size and confirm, not a buy list; cycle state is a drawdown/structure tool, not a timing oracle.', '周期入场 + 均值回归（A股已验证的效应），残差相对强度仅作轻量质量加权。经深度历史校正：A股均值回归 —— 动量并非优势。用于定仓与确认的名单，而非买入清单；周期状态是回撤/结构工具，而非择时神谕。') }}</p>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ===================== STOCK SCREENER (consolidated · toggle) ===================== -->
  {% if scoreboard and scoreboard.modes %}
  <div class="panel span12" id="stock-screener">
    <h2>{{ t('🎯 Stock screener — one board, two validated lenses', '🎯 选股面板 — 一板双镜') }}
      <span class="note" style="text-transform:none">· {{ t('switch the lens; the table re-sorts', '切换视角；表格随之重排') }}{% if scoreboard.as_of %} · {{ scoreboard.as_of }}{% endif %}</span>
      {{ help("The scattered single-signal screens, consolidated into ONE switchable board. Two validated lenses — flip between them with the toggle: <b>Mean-reversion</b> = the deepest 3-month within-sector dips (the one robust, FDR-surviving A-share edge: cross-sectional Sharpe 0.58; a high-variance contrarian signal that buys into weakness). <b>Low-vol defensive</b> = the lowest-volatility names (market-like returns, shallower drawdowns → higher Sharpe; a risk-REDUCING tilt, not a return-maximizer). Click any column to sort. Context to size and confirm — NOT a buy list.", "把分散的单一信号筛选合并为一块可切换的面板。两种已验证视角 —— 用开关切换：<b>均值回归</b>＝板块内近3月跌幅最深者（A股唯一稳健、通过FDR的优势：横截面夏普0.58；高波动逆向信号，买入弱势）。<b>防御低波</b>＝波动率最低的个股（收益与市场相近、回撤更浅→更高夏普；降低风险的倾向，而非收益最大化）。点击任意列排序。用于定仓与确认的背景 —— 而非买入清单。") }}
    </h2>
    <div class="sb-seg" role="tablist" aria-label="screener mode">
      <button role="tab" data-mode="reversal" aria-selected="true">{{ t('🔄 Mean-reversion', '🔄 均值回归') }}</button>
      <button role="tab" data-mode="lowvol" aria-selected="false">{{ t('🛡 Low-vol defensive', '🛡 防御低波') }}</button>
    </div>
    <p class="note sb-cap" id="sb-cap"><!-- per-mode caption injected by JS --></p>
    <table class="sb-table"><thead id="sb-head"></thead><tbody id="sb-body"></tbody></table>
    <p class="note" style="margin:8px 0 0;font-size:11px">{{ t('Validated A-share effects only: short-term within-sector REVERSAL (Sharpe 0.58) and the LOW-VOL defensive tilt (Sharpe 0.98 vs 0.88 market). Classic momentum / value / quality were tested over ~35 years and do NOT clear FDR on A-shares. A research surface to size and confirm — not a confident buy list; cycle state is a drawdown/structure tool, not a timing oracle.', '仅采用已验证的A股效应：短期板块内反转（夏普0.58）与低波防御倾向（夏普0.98 对 市场0.88）。经典动量／价值／质量在约35年里测试均未通过FDR。用于定仓与确认的研究面板 —— 而非买入清单；周期状态是回撤/结构工具，而非择时神谕。') }}</p>
    <script type="application/json" id="sb-data">{{ scoreboard.modes | tojson }}</script>
    <script type="application/json" id="sb-seczh">{{ SECZH | tojson }}</script>
    <script>
    (function () {
      var DATA, SECZH;
      try { DATA = JSON.parse(document.getElementById('sb-data').textContent); } catch (e) { return; }
      try { SECZH = JSON.parse(document.getElementById('sb-seczh').textContent); } catch (e) { SECZH = {}; }
      var head = document.getElementById('sb-head'), body = document.getElementById('sb-body'),
          cap = document.getElementById('sb-cap'),
          seg = document.querySelector('#stock-screener .sb-seg');
      // bilingual span (CSS shows the active language)
      function bl(en, zh) { return '<span class="l-en">' + en + '</span><span class="l-zh">' + (zh || en) + '</span>'; }
      function sgn(v, d) { return (v >= 0 ? '+' : '') + v.toFixed(d); }
      function cls(v) { return v >= 0 ? 'pos' : 'neg'; }
      function nm(name) { var p = String(name || '').split(' / '); return bl(p[0], p[1] || p[0]); }
      function ladDir(d) { return d === 'up' ? 'up' : (d === 'down' ? 'down' : 'flat'); }
      var COL = {
        stock: { en: 'Stock', zh: '个股', l: true, key: function (r) { return r.ticker; },
          cell: function (r) { return '<a href="china_lookup.html#' + r.ticker + '"><b>' + r.ticker + '</b></a> <span class="note">' + nm(r.name) + '</span>'; } },
        sector: { en: 'Sector', zh: '板块', l: true, key: function (r) { return r.sector || ''; },
          cell: function (r) { return '<span class="note">' + bl(r.sector || '—', SECZH[r.sector] || r.sector || '—') + '</span>'; } },
        price: { en: 'Price', zh: '价格', key: function (r) { return r.price; },
          cell: function (r) { return r.price != null ? r.price.toFixed(2) : '—'; } },
        cycle: { en: 'Cycle', zh: '周期', l: true, key: null,
          cell: function (r) { return r.cycle ? '<span class="lad ' + ladDir(r.cycle_dir) + '">' + bl(r.cycle, r.cycle_zh || r.cycle) + '</span>' : '—'; } },
        ret3m: { en: '3-mo', zh: '近3月', key: function (r) { return r.ret_3m; },
          cell: function (r) { return r.ret_3m != null ? '<span class="neg">' + sgn(r.ret_3m, 1) + '%</span>' : '—'; } },
        revz: { en: 'rev-z', zh: '反转强度', key: function (r) { return r.rev_z; }, def: 'desc',
          cell: function (r) { return r.rev_z != null ? '<b>' + r.rev_z.toFixed(2) + '</b>' : '—'; } },
        srank: { en: 'sector rank', zh: '板块排名', key: function (r) { return r.sector_rank; },
          cell: function (r) { return r.sector_rank != null ? '<span class="note">' + r.sector_rank + '/' + r.sector_n + '</span>' : '—'; } },
        mcap: { en: 'mkt cap', zh: '市值', key: function (r) { return r.mktcap_yi; },
          cell: function (r) { return r.mktcap_yi != null ? '<span class="note">' + Math.round(r.mktcap_yi) + '亿</span>' : '—'; } },
        vol: { en: 'σ (ann)', zh: '年化波动', key: function (r) { return r.vol_pct_ann; }, def: 'asc',
          cell: function (r) { return r.vol_pct_ann != null ? '<b>' + r.vol_pct_ann.toFixed(1) + '%</b>' : '—'; } },
        beta: { en: 'beta', zh: '贝塔', key: function (r) { return r.beta; },
          cell: function (r) { return r.beta != null ? '<span class="note">' + r.beta.toFixed(2) + '</span>' : '—'; } },
      };
      var MODES = {
        reversal: { cols: ['stock', 'sector', 'price', 'ret3m', 'revz', 'srank', 'mcap', 'cycle'],
          cap: bl('The most beaten-down names vs their sector over 3 months — the validated A-share edge (within-sector reversal, Sharpe 0.58). A high-variance contrarian signal that buys into weakness; size small, not a buy list.', '近3个月相对其板块跌幅最深的个股 —— 已验证的A股优势（板块内反转，夏普0.58）。高波动逆向信号，买入弱势；宜小仓位，而非买入清单。') },
        lowvol: { cols: ['stock', 'sector', 'price', 'vol', 'beta', 'mcap', 'cycle'],
          cap: bl('The lowest-volatility names — historically market-like returns with shallower drawdowns (the validated defensive tilt, Sharpe 0.98 vs 0.88 market). For risk-aware exposure, not return maximization.', '波动率最低的个股 —— 历史上收益与市场相近但回撤更浅（已验证的防御倾向，夏普0.98 对 市场0.88）。用于风险可控的敞口，而非收益最大化。') },
      };
      var cur = 'reversal', sortCol = null, sortDir = 'desc';
      function render() {
        var spec = MODES[cur], cols = spec.cols.map(function (c) { return COL[c]; });
        cap.innerHTML = spec.cap;
        // header
        var hh = '<tr>';
        cols.forEach(function (c, i) {
          var sortable = c.key !== null;
          var arrow = '';
          if (sortable) arrow = '<span class="sarrow">' + (sortCol === i ? (sortDir === 'desc' ? '↓' : '↑') : '↕') + '</span>';
          hh += '<th class="' + (c.l ? 'l ' : '') + (sortable ? 'th-sort ' : '') + (sortCol === i ? 'sorted' : '') + '"'
              + (sortable ? ' data-i="' + i + '"' : '') + '>' + bl(c.en, c.zh) + arrow + '</th>';
        });
        hh += '</tr>';
        head.innerHTML = hh;
        // rows
        var rows = DATA[cur] ? DATA[cur].slice() : [];
        if (sortCol !== null && cols[sortCol] && cols[sortCol].key) {
          var kf = cols[sortCol].key, sgnd = sortDir === 'desc' ? -1 : 1;
          rows.sort(function (a, b) {
            var va = kf(a), vb = kf(b);
            if (va == null) va = -Infinity; if (vb == null) vb = -Infinity;
            if (typeof va === 'string' || typeof vb === 'string')
              return sgnd * String(va).localeCompare(String(vb), undefined, { numeric: true });
            return sgnd * (va - vb);
          });
        }
        var bb = '';
        rows.forEach(function (r) {
          bb += '<tr>' + cols.map(function (c) {
            return '<td class="' + (c.l ? 'l' : '') + '">' + c.cell(r) + '</td>';
          }).join('') + '</tr>';
        });
        body.innerHTML = bb || '<tr><td>—</td></tr>';
      }
      // default sort per mode
      function setMode(m) {
        cur = m;
        var cols = MODES[cur].cols.map(function (c) { return COL[c]; });
        sortCol = null; sortDir = 'desc';
        cols.forEach(function (c, i) { if (c.def && sortCol === null) { sortCol = i; sortDir = c.def; } });
        Array.prototype.forEach.call(seg.querySelectorAll('button'), function (b) {
          b.setAttribute('aria-selected', b.getAttribute('data-mode') === m ? 'true' : 'false');
        });
        render();
      }
      seg.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
        var b = e.target.closest('button[data-mode]'); if (!b) return;
        setMode(b.getAttribute('data-mode'));
      });
      head.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
        var th = e.target.closest('th.th-sort'); if (!th) return;
        var i = parseInt(th.getAttribute('data-i'), 10);
        if (sortCol === i) sortDir = sortDir === 'desc' ? 'asc' : 'desc';
        else { sortCol = i; sortDir = 'desc'; }
        render();
      });
      setMode('reversal');
    })();
    </script>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ===================== ALPHA LEADERS (sector-neutral residual momentum) ===================== -->
  {% if alpha and alpha.top %}
  <div class="panel span12" id="alpha-leaders">
    <h2>{{ t('📊 Sector relative strength — read the mean-reversion flag', '📊 板块相对强度 — 关注均值回归标记') }}
      <span class="note" style="text-transform:none">· {{ t('sector-neutral residual · vs CSI 300', '板块中性残差 · 相对沪深300') }}{% if alpha.n %} · {{ alpha.n }} {{ t('names', '只') }}{% endif %}</span>
      {{ help("Each stock's return with its MARKET and SECTOR beta stripped — <b>sector-neutral residual relative strength</b> over a 12-1-month window (rank vs the whole A-share cross-section; +2 = top of the pack). <b>IMPORTANT — deep-history correction:</b> on ~35 years of A-share data this momentum is NOT a validated edge — A-shares MEAN-REVERT, so do not read 'high alpha = buy' (research/CHINA_HK_STOCK_SIGNALS.md, reports/china-residual-alpha-deep.md). Read the <b>entry</b> flag instead: a leader that just spiked (“extended”) is a reversal RISK / fade candidate; a leader on a recent pullback (“pullback”) is the constructive MEAN-REVERSION entry — the validated effect. The alpha column is relative-strength CONTEXT (which names have shown strength), not a buy ranking.", "每只股票剔除其市场与板块贝塔后的收益 —— <b>板块中性残差相对强度</b>（12-1 个月；相对全 A 股横截面排名，+2＝最强一档）。<b>重要 —— 深度历史校正：</b>在约35年的A股数据上，该动量并非有效优势 —— A股<b>均值回归</b>，因此切勿把“高 alpha＝买入”（research/CHINA_HK_STOCK_SIGNALS.md、reports/china-residual-alpha-deep.md）。请改看<b>入场</b>标记：刚急涨的领先股（“extended”）是反转风险/做空候选；近期回调的领先股（“pullback”）才是有效的<b>均值回归</b>入场。alpha 列是相对强度<b>背景</b>（哪些个股表现出强势），并非买入排序。") }}
    </h2>
    <table class="sortable">
      <thead><tr>
        <th class="l">{{ t('Stock', '个股') }}</th>
        <th class="l">{{ t('Sector', '板块') }}</th>
        <th>{{ t('alpha z', '阿尔法 z') }}</th>
        <th>{{ t('sector rank', '板块排名') }}</th>
        <th>{{ t('idio ann', '年化残差') }}</th>
        <th>{{ t('1-mo', '近一月') }}</th>
        <th class="l">{{ t('entry', '入场') }}</th>
      </tr></thead>
      <tbody>
      {% for a in alpha.top[:16] %}
      <tr>
        <td class="l"><a href="china_lookup.html#{{ a.ticker }}"><b>{{ a.ticker }}</b></a> <span class="note">{{ nm(a.name) }}</span></td>
        <td class="l note">{{ t(a.sector, SECZH.get(a.sector, a.sector)) }}</td>
        <td><b class="{{ 'pos' if (a.alpha or 0)>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ '%+.2f'|format(a.alpha) if a.alpha is not none else '—' }}</b></td>
        <td class="note">{{ a.sector_rank }}/{{ a.sector_n }}</td>
        <td class="{{ 'pos' if (a.resid_ann or 0)>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ '%+.0f'|format(a.resid_ann) ~ '%' if a.resid_ann is not none else '—' }}</td>
        <td class="{{ 'pos' if (a.rev_1m or 0)>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ '%+.1f'|format(a.rev_1m) ~ '%' if a.rev_1m is not none else '—' }}</td>
        <td class="l">{% if a.entry %}<span class="alpha-entry ae-{{ a.entry }}">{{ a.entry }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p class="note" style="margin:6px 0 0;font-size:11px">{{ t('Sector-neutral residual relative strength. Deep-history corrected: A-share momentum is NOT a validated edge (35y, nothing clears FDR) — the robust effect is short-term REVERSAL, so the actionable read is the entry flag (pullback = mean-reversion buy; extended = fade risk), not the alpha ranking. Relative-strength context, not a buy list.', '板块中性残差相对强度。经深度历史校正：A股动量并非有效优势（35年，无一通过FDR）—— 稳健的效应是短期反转，因此可操作的解读是入场标记（pullback＝均值回归买入；extended＝做空风险），而非 alpha 排序。相对强度背景，而非买入清单。') }}</p>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% endif %}{# /mode != macro — stock block (top setups, mean-reversion watch, alpha leaders) #}

  {% set I = internals or {} %}

  {% if mode != 'stocks' %}
  <!-- ===================== CROWD METER (margin / 融资融券) ===================== -->
  {% if I.margin %}
  <div class="panel span6" id="internals">
    <h2>{{ t('🔥 Margin crowd meter', '🔥 两融拥挤度') }} <span class="note" style="text-transform:none">· {{ t('融资融券 — the A-share COT', '融资融券 — A股的持仓拥挤度') }}</span>
      {{ help("<b>Financing balance as a % of free-float</b> — a self-normalizing China retail-leverage gauge (closest analog to US CFTC positioning); it peaked near 4.7% at the 2015 bubble top.<div class='scale'><span style='background:var(--info)'>capitulated</span><span style='background:var(--muted)'>normal</span><span style='background:var(--warn)'>elevated</span><span style='background:var(--act)'>crowded</span></div><div class='sl'><span>0</span><span>40th</span><span>70th</span><span>100th %ile</span></div><b>Maintenance ratio</b> = system-wide distance to a margin call; <b>froth</b> = margin trades as a share of turnover.", "<b>融资余额占流通市值比</b> — 可自我归一化的散户杠杆指标（最接近美国 CFTC 持仓）；2015 杠杆牛顶部曾接近 4.7%。<div class='scale'><span style='background:var(--info)'>已出清</span><span style='background:var(--muted)'>正常</span><span style='background:var(--warn)'>偏高</span><span style='background:var(--act)'>拥挤</span></div><div class='sl'><span>0</span><span>40分位</span><span>70分位</span><span>100分位</span></div><b>维持担保比例</b>＝全市场距强平的远近；<b>换手占比</b>＝两融交易占成交额比重。") }}
    </h2>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px">
      <span class="bignum {{ 'neg' if I.margin.pctile>=80 else ('pos' if I.margin.pctile<=25 else '') }}">{{ I.margin.fin_pct_float }}%</span>
      <span class="sub">{{ t('financing / float', '融资 / 流通市值') }} · {{ t('pctile', '分位') }} <b style="color:var(--text)">{{ I.margin.pctile }}</b>{% if I.margin.chg_20d is not none %} · 20d {{ '%+.2f'|format(I.margin.chg_20d) }}{% endif %}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="dial"><i style="left:{{ I.margin.pctile }}%"></i></div>
    <div class="dial-ends"><span>{{ t('capitulated', '已出清') }}</span><span>{{ t('peak', '峰值') }} {{ I.margin.peak }}% ({{ I.margin.peak_date }})</span><span>{{ t('crowded', '拥挤') }}</span></div>
    <div class="tiles">
      {% if I.margin.guarantee_ratio is defined %}<div class="tile"><div class="tv {{ 'neg' if I.margin.guarantee_ratio<160 else '' }}">{{ I.margin.guarantee_ratio }}%</div><div class="tk">{{ t('maint. ratio', '维持担保') }}</div></div>{% endif %}
      {% if I.margin.trade_amt_ratio is defined %}<div class="tile"><div class="tv">{{ I.margin.trade_amt_ratio }}%</div><div class="tk">{{ t('% of turnover', '占成交额') }}</div></div>{% endif %}
      {% if I.margin.net_fin_buy_20d is not none %}<div class="tile"><div class="tv {{ 'pos' if I.margin.net_fin_buy_20d>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ '%+d'|format(I.margin.net_fin_buy_20d) }}</div><div class="tk">{{ t('20d net buy (亿)', '20日净买入(亿)') }}</div></div>{% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="chart">{{ I.margin.chart_html | safe }}</div>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ===================== SOUTHBOUND FLOW (南向资金) ===================== -->
  {% if I.southbound %}
  <div class="panel span6">
    <h2>{{ t('🇭🇰 Southbound flow', '🇭🇰 南向资金') }} <span class="note" style="text-transform:none">· {{ t('mainland → Hong Kong', '内地 → 香港') }}</span>
      {{ help("Net mainland buying of Hong Kong via Stock Connect — the live half of the Connect flows (northbound daily direction was discontinued by regulators in Aug-2024). The z-score is today’s net vs its trailing-year distribution; the chart is the 20-day cumulative net. Persistent southbound buying is a mainland risk-appetite tell.", "经港股通的内地净买入香港 — 互联互通中仍实时披露的一侧（北向每日方向于 2024 年 8 月被监管停披）。Z 值为当日净额相对近一年分布；图为 20 日累计净额。持续南下是内地风险偏好的信号。") }}
    </h2>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px">
      <span class="bignum {{ 'pos' if I.southbound.net>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ '{:+,.0f}'.format(I.southbound.net) }}</span>
      <span class="sub">{{ t('today net', '今日净额') }} · z {{ '%+.2f'|format(I.southbound.net_z) }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="tiles">
      <div class="tile"><div class="tv {{ 'pos' if I.southbound.cum_20d>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ '{:+,.0f}'.format(I.southbound.cum_20d) }}</div><div class="tk">{{ t('20d cumulative', '20日累计') }}</div></div>
      <div class="tile"><div class="tv">{{ I.southbound.pos_days_20 }}/20</div><div class="tk">{{ t('net-buy days', '净买入天数') }}</div></div>
      {% if I.southbound.hold_mktcap is defined %}<div class="tile"><div class="tv">¥{{ (I.southbound.hold_mktcap/10000)|round(1) }}{{ t('T', '万亿') }}</div><div class="tk">{{ t('holdings', '持仓市值') }}</div></div>{% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="chart">{{ I.southbound.chart_html | safe }}</div>
    <p class="note" style="margin:2px 0 0;font-size:11px">{{ t('Northbound daily direction discontinued Aug-2024 (turnover only).', '北向每日方向自 2024 年 8 月停止披露（仅余成交额）。') }}</p>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ===================== CONNECT LEADERBOARD (smart money) ===================== -->
  {% if leaderboard %}
  <div class="panel span8">
    <h2>{{ t('🌐 Connect leaderboard — smart money', '🌐 互联互通龙虎榜 — 聪明钱') }}
      {{ help("Where cross-border money is concentrated today:<table><tr><th>Leg</th><th>What it shows</th></tr><tr><td><b>Northbound</b><br>foreign → A</td><td>the A-shares foreign money traded most — turnover only (daily net discontinued Aug-2024)</td></tr><tr><td><b>Southbound</b><br>mainland → HK</td><td>HK names mainland money net-bought / net-sold — a live read on mainland risk appetite offshore</td></tr></table>", "今日跨境资金的集中之处：<table><tr><th>方向</th><th>含义</th></tr><tr><td><b>北向</b><br>外资 → A 股</td><td>外资成交额最大的 A 股 — 仅成交额（每日净额自 2024 年 8 月停止）</td></tr><tr><td><b>南向</b><br>内地 → 港股</td><td>内地资金净买入／净卖出的港股 — 实时反映内地离岸风险偏好</td></tr></table>") }}
    </h2>
    <div class="grid" style="gap:18px">
      <div class="span6">
        <h3>{{ t('Northbound — most-active A-shares', '北向 — 最活跃 A 股') }} <span class="note" style="text-transform:none">· {{ t('foreign turnover', '外资成交额') }}</span></h3>
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th class="l">{{ t('Stock', '个股') }}</th><th>{{ t('Turnover 亿', '成交额 亿') }}</th><th>{{ t('Day', '当日') }}</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
          {% for x in leaderboard.nb %}
          <tr><td class="l">{{ x.name }} <span class="note">{{ x.code }}</span></td><td>{{ '%.1f'|format(x.val) }}</td><td class="{{ 'pos' if x.chg>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ '%+.1f'|format(x.chg) }}%</td></tr>
          {% else %}<tr><td class="l note" colspan="3">—</td></tr>{% endfor %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class="span6">
        <h3>{{ t('Southbound — mainland net (HK)', '南向 — 内地净额 (港股)') }} <span class="note" style="text-transform:none">· {{ t('net buy / sell', '净买/卖') }}</span></h3>
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th class="l">{{ t('Stock', '个股') }}</th><th>{{ t('Net 亿', '净额 亿') }}</th><th>{{ t('Day', '当日') }}</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
          {% for x in leaderboard.sb_buy %}
          <tr><td class="l">{{ x.name }}</td><td class="pos">{{ '%+.1f'|format(x.val) }}</td><td class="{{ 'pos' if x.chg>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ '%+.1f'|format(x.chg) }}%</td></tr>
          {% endfor %}
          {% for x in leaderboard.sb_sell %}{% if x.val < 0 %}
          <tr><td class="l">{{ x.name }}</td><td class="neg">{{ '%+.1f'|format(x.val) }}</td><td class="{{ 'pos' if x.chg>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ '%+.1f'|format(x.chg) }}%</td></tr>
          {% endif %}{% endfor %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="note" style="margin:6px 0 0;font-size:11px">{{ t('as of', '截至') }} {{ leaderboard.date }}</p>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ===================== PBoC POLICY (RRR / 存准率) ===================== -->
  {% if I.pboc %}
  <div class="panel span4">
    <h2>{{ t('🏛️ PBoC policy — RRR', '🏛️ 央行政策 — 存准率') }}
      {{ help("<b>RRR (存款准备金率)</b> — the PBoC main liquidity lever:<div class='lad up'><b>CUT 降准</b> — frees bank reserves to lend → easing, supportive for equities</div><div class='lad down'><b>HIKE 升准</b> — drains reserves → tightening, a headwind</div>The 2-year net change shows the policy stance (Asia-coloured: a cut is the up-colour).", "<b>存款准备金率</b> — 央行主要的流动性工具：<div class='lad up'><b>降准 CUT</b> — 释放银行可贷资金 → 宽松，利好股市</div><div class='lad down'><b>升准 HIKE</b> — 回收资金 → 收紧，构成逆风</div>近两年累计变动显示政策立场（按亚洲习惯着色：降准为上涨色）。") }}
    </h2>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:4px">
      <span class="bignum">{{ I.pboc.rrr_big }}%</span>
      <span class="chip {{ 'c-up' if I.pboc.bias=='easing' else ('c-down' if I.pboc.bias=='tightening' else 'c-muted') }}">{{ t(I.pboc.bias, {'easing':'宽松','tightening':'收紧','neutral':'中性'}[I.pboc.bias]) }}</span>
    </div>
    <span class="sub">{{ t('big-bank reserve ratio', '大型银行存准率') }}{% if I.pboc.net_2y %} · {{ t('2y', '近2年') }} {{ '%+.2f'|format(I.pboc.net_2y) }}pp{% endif %}</span>
    <table style="margin-top:10px">
      <thead><tr><th class="l">{{ t('Date', '日期') }}</th><th>{{ t('Move', '变动') }}</th><th>{{ t('To', '至') }}</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
      {% for e in I.pboc.events %}
      <tr><td class="l">{{ e.date }}</td><td class="{{ 'pos' if e.dir=='cut' else 'neg' }}">{{ t('cut', '降') if e.dir=='cut' else t('hike', '升') }} {{ '%.2f'|format(e.change|abs) }}pp</td><td>{{ e.level }}%</td></tr>
      {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ===================== CREDIT & MACRO TAPE ===================== -->
  {% if I.credit %}
  <div class="panel span8">
    <h2>{{ t('🏦 Credit impulse & macro tape', '🏦 信贷脉冲与宏观盘面') }}
      {{ help("China's credit/liquidity pulse. The CREDIT IMPULSE (year-on-year change of trailing-12-month Total Social Financing 社融) is the single most-watched China macro lead — it turns up ~2 quarters before risk assets and commodities. The M1-M2 scissors (M1 YoY minus M2 YoY) is a faster animal-spirits gauge — above zero = money turning active. Tape tiles show the latest year-on-year for investment, retail and trade (arrow = vs 3 months ago).", "中国的信贷／流动性脉搏。信贷脉冲（滚动 12 个月社会融资规模的同比变化）是最受关注的中国宏观领先指标 — 通常领先风险资产与大宗商品约两个季度。M1-M2 剪刀差是更快的风险偏好指标 — 高于零＝资金活化。盘面磁贴显示投资、消费与贸易的最新同比（箭头＝相对三个月前）。") }}
    </h2>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start">
      {% if I.credit.credit_impulse is defined %}
      <div style="flex:1 1 280px;min-width:250px">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px">
          <span class="bignum {{ 'pos' if I.credit.credit_impulse>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ '%+.1f'|format(I.credit.credit_impulse) }}%</span>
          <span class="sub">{{ t('credit impulse (社融脉冲)', '社融信贷脉冲') }}{% if I.credit.credit_impulse_6mo is not none %} · {{ t('was', '6月前') }} {{ '%+.1f'|format(I.credit.credit_impulse_6mo) }}%{% endif %}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="chart">{{ I.credit.impulse_html | safe }}</div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
      {% if I.credit.scissors is defined %}
      <div style="flex:1 1 280px;min-width:250px">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px">
          <span class="bignum {{ 'pos' if I.credit.scissors>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ '%+.1f'|format(I.credit.scissors) }}</span>
          <span class="sub">{{ t('M1−M2 scissors (剪刀差, pp)', 'M1−M2 剪刀差 (pp)') }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="chart">{{ I.credit.scissors_html | safe }}</div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="tiles" style="margin-top:8px">
      {% if I.credit.tsf_12m is defined %}<div class="tile"><div class="tv">¥{{ I.credit.tsf_12m }}{{ t('T', '万亿') }}</div><div class="tk">{{ t('TSF trailing-12m (社融)', '社融(滚动12月)') }}</div></div>{% endif %}
      {% if I.credit.new_loans is defined %}<div class="tile"><div class="tv">¥{{ (I.credit.new_loans/10000)|round(2) }}{{ t('T', '万亿') }}</div><div class="tk">{{ t('new loans/mo', '当月新增贷款') }}{% if I.credit.new_loans_yoy is not none %} · {{ '%+.0f'|format(I.credit.new_loans_yoy) }}%{% endif %}</div></div>{% endif %}
      {% if I.credit.tape %}{% for tp in I.credit.tape %}
        {% set sp = tp.spark %}{% set up = (sp|length>=4 and sp[-1] >= sp[-4]) %}
        <div class="tile" style="flex:1 1 76px;min-width:76px"><div class="tv {{ 'pos' if tp.val>=0 else 'neg' }}" style="font-size:14px">{{ '%+.1f'|format(tp.val) }}% <span class="sub">{{ '▲' if up else '▼' }}</span></div><div class="tk">{{ t(tp.en, tp.zh) }}</div></div>
      {% endfor %}{% endif %}
    </div>
    {% if I.credit.tsf_mix %}
    <p class="note" style="margin:8px 0 0">{{ t('Latest month 社融 mix (亿)', '当月社融结构(亿)') }}: {{ t('bank loans', '银行贷款') }} <b class="{{ 'pos' if I.credit.tsf_mix.bank>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ '{:+,d}'.format(I.credit.tsf_mix.bank) }}</b> · {{ t('bonds', '债券') }} <b class="{{ 'pos' if I.credit.tsf_mix.bond>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ '{:+,d}'.format(I.credit.tsf_mix.bond) }}</b> · {{ t('shadow', '影子') }} <b class="{{ 'pos' if I.credit.tsf_mix.shadow>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ '{:+,d}'.format(I.credit.tsf_mix.shadow) }}</b> · {{ t('equity', '股票') }} <b class="{{ 'pos' if I.credit.tsf_mix.equity>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ '{:+,d}'.format(I.credit.tsf_mix.equity) }}</b></p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ===================== PROPERTY & FISCAL ===================== -->
  {% if property %}{% set P = property %}{% set R = P.regime %}
  <div class="panel span12">
    <h2>{{ t('🏗️ Property & Fiscal', '🏗️ 房地产与财政') }}
      {% set rc = {'neg':'c-down','warn':'c-warn','pos':'c-up','neutral':'c-muted'}[R.tone] %}
      <span class="chip {{ rc }}" style="margin-left:6px">{{ t(R.label_en, R.label_zh) }}</span>
      {{ help("China's property cycle — a third of GDP and the heart of household wealth. The headline is the <b>70-city price diffusion</b> (cities with month-on-month price rises minus those falling); below zero = more cities falling than rising. The <b>NBS climate index</b> (100 = neutral) bundles the investment/sales/land cycle. <b>Rebar &amp; iron-ore</b> futures are the high-frequency construction-demand pulse. The <b>10-year CGB yield</b> is the fiscal/duration read (falling = the bond market pricing disinflation + easing), and the <b>512200 property-ETF drawdown</b> stands in for developer stress (a free, market-priced proxy for the LGFV spreads that are paid + policy-administered). <b>Context only — A-shares mean-revert, so this is a regime read, not a trade signal.</b>", "中国房地产周期 — 约占 GDP 三分之一，也是居民财富的核心。核心指标是<b>70 城价格宽度</b>（环比上涨城市数减去下跌城市数）；低于零＝下跌城市多于上涨。<b>国房景气指数</b>（100＝中性）综合了投资／销售／土地周期。<b>螺纹钢与铁矿石</b>期货是高频的建材需求脉搏。<b>10 年期国债收益率</b>是财政／久期视角（下行＝债市定价通缩+宽松），<b>512200 地产 ETF 回撤</b>替代开发商压力（对 LGFV 利差这一付费且受政策管制指标的免费市场化替代）。<b>仅作背景 — A 股均值回归，这是周期判读而非交易信号。</b>") }}
    </h2>
    <p class="note" style="margin:-2px 0 10px">{% for d in R.drivers %}{% if not loop.first %} · {% endif %}<span class="{{ 'pos' if d.sign>0 else 'neg' if d.sign<0 else '' }}">{{ t(d.en, d.zh) }}</span>{% endfor %}</p>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start">

      {% if P.breadth %}
      <div style="flex:1 1 300px;min-width:280px">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px">
          <span class="bignum {{ 'pos' if P.breadth.new>0 else 'neg' if P.breadth.new<0 else '' }}">{{ '%+d'|format(P.breadth.new) }}</span>
          <span class="sub">{{ t('70-city price breadth', '70城价格宽度') }} · {{ P.breadth.rising }}↑ {{ P.breadth.falling }}↓ {{ P.breadth.flat }}→ · {{ P.breadth.date }}</span>
        </div>
        <p class="note" style="margin:3px 0 0">
          {% if P.breadth.trend_6m is not none %}{{ t('6-mo trend', '近6月趋势') }} <b class="{{ 'pos' if P.breadth.trend_6m>0 else 'neg' if P.breadth.trend_6m<0 else '' }}">{{ '%+d'|format(P.breadth.trend_6m) }}</b>{% endif %}
          {% if P.breadth.tier1_mom is not none %} · {{ t('tier-1 MoM', '一线环比') }} <b class="{{ 'pos' if P.breadth.tier1_mom>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ '%+.1f'|format(P.breadth.tier1_mom) }}%</b>{% endif %}
          {% if P.breadth.second is not none %} · {{ t('2nd-hand', '二手') }} <b class="{{ 'pos' if P.breadth.second>0 else 'neg' }}">{{ '%+d'|format(P.breadth.second) }}</b>{% endif %}
        </p>
        {% if P.breadth.chart_html %}<div class="chart">{{ P.breadth.chart_html | safe }}</div>{% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if P.climate %}
      <div style="flex:1 1 300px;min-width:280px">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px">
          <span class="bignum {{ 'neg' if P.climate.level<100 else 'pos' }}">{{ P.climate.level }}</span>
          <span class="sub">{{ t('NBS climate index (国房景气)', '国房景气指数') }} · {{ P.climate.date }}</span>
        </div>
        <p class="note" style="margin:3px 0 0">{{ t('MoM', '环比') }} <b class="{{ 'pos' if P.climate.chg>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ '%+.2f'|format(P.climate.chg) }}%</b>{% if P.climate.chg_12m is not none %} · {{ t('12-mo', '近12月') }} <b class="{{ 'pos' if P.climate.chg_12m>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ '%+.2f'|format(P.climate.chg_12m) }}</b>{% endif %} · {{ t('100 = neutral', '100＝中性') }}</p>
        {% if P.climate.chart_html %}<div class="chart">{{ P.climate.chart_html | safe }}</div>{% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if P.construction %}{% set K = P.construction %}
      <div style="flex:1 1 300px;min-width:280px">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px">
          {% if K.demand_z is not none %}<span class="bignum {{ 'pos' if K.demand_z>0 else 'neg' if K.demand_z<0 else '' }}">{{ '%+.2f'|format(K.demand_z) }}</span>{% endif %}
          <span class="sub">{{ t('construction-demand z', '建材需求 z') }} · {{ t('rebar + iron-ore', '螺纹+铁矿') }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="tiles" style="margin-top:5px">
          {% if K.rebar is defined %}<div class="tile"><div class="tv">{{ K.rebar }}{% if K.rebar_mom is not none %} <span class="sub {{ 'pos' if K.rebar_mom>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ '%+.1f'|format(K.rebar_mom) }}%</span>{% endif %}</div><div class="tk">{{ t('rebar 螺纹', '螺纹钢') }}</div></div>{% endif %}
          {% if K.iron_ore is defined %}<div class="tile"><div class="tv">{{ K.iron_ore }}{% if K.iron_ore_mom is not none %} <span class="sub {{ 'pos' if K.iron_ore_mom>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ '%+.1f'|format(K.iron_ore_mom) }}%</span>{% endif %}</div><div class="tk">{{ t('iron-ore 铁矿', '铁矿石') }}</div></div>{% endif %}
        </div>
        {% if K.chart_html %}<div class="chart">{{ K.chart_html | safe }}</div>{% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if P.cgb %}
      <div style="flex:1 1 300px;min-width:280px">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px">
          <span class="bignum">{{ P.cgb.y10 }}%</span>
          <span class="sub">{{ t('10-year CGB yield', '10年期国债收益率') }} · {{ t('fiscal / duration', '财政/久期') }}</span>
        </div>
        <p class="note" style="margin:3px 0 0">
          {% if P.cgb.slope is not none %}{{ t('10y−2y slope', '10年−2年期限利差') }} <b>{{ '%+.2f'|format(P.cgb.slope) }}</b>{% endif %}
          {% if P.cgb.chg_6m is not none %} · {{ t('6-mo Δ', '近6月') }} <b class="{{ 'neg' if P.cgb.chg_6m<0 else 'pos' }}">{{ '%+.2f'|format(P.cgb.chg_6m) }}pp</b>{% endif %}
          {% if P.cgb.pctile is not none %} · {{ t('pctile', '分位') }} {{ P.cgb.pctile }}{% endif %}
        </p>
        {% if P.cgb.chart_html %}<div class="chart">{{ P.cgb.chart_html | safe }}</div>{% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if P.prop_etf %}
      <div style="flex:1 1 300px;min-width:280px">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px">
          <span class="bignum neg">{{ P.prop_etf.drawdown }}%</span>
          <span class="sub">{{ t('property-ETF drawdown (512200)', '地产 ETF 回撤 (512200)') }}</span>
        </div>
        <p class="note" style="margin:3px 0 0">{{ t('from ATH', '距历史高点') }} {{ P.prop_etf.ath_date }} · {{ t('developer-stress proxy', '开发商压力替代') }}</p>
        {% if P.prop_etf.chart_html %}<div class="chart">{{ P.prop_etf.chart_html | safe }}</div>{% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}

    </div>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ===================== SENTIMENT THERMOMETER ===================== -->
  {% if I.flows or I.turnover %}
  <div class="panel span4">
    <h2>{{ t('🌡️ Sentiment thermometer', '🌡️ 情绪温度计') }}
      {{ help("<b>Two-market turnover (成交额)</b> — the headline retail-mania gauge:<div class='scale'><span style='background:var(--muted)'>apathy</span><span style='background:var(--info)'>normal</span><span style='background:var(--warn)'>active</span><span style='background:var(--act)'>mania</span></div><div class='sl'><span>&lt;¥0.7T</span><span>¥1.2T</span><span>¥1.8T</span><span>&gt;¥1.8T</span></div><b>AH premium</b> &gt;100 = A-shares richer than their HK twins. <b>Seal rate</b> = limit-ups that stayed sealed; many limit-ups + a falling seal rate flags topping froth.", "<b>两市成交额</b> — 核心的散户狂热指标：<div class='scale'><span style='background:var(--muted)'>清淡</span><span style='background:var(--info)'>正常</span><span style='background:var(--warn)'>活跃</span><span style='background:var(--act)'>狂热</span></div><div class='sl'><span>&lt;0.7万亿</span><span>1.2万亿</span><span>1.8万亿</span><span>&gt;1.8万亿</span></div><b>AH 溢价</b> &gt;100＝A 股比港股孪生股更贵。<b>封板率</b>＝封住未开板的涨停比例；涨停多而封板率下降预示投机见顶。") }}
    </h2>
    {% if I.turnover %}
    {% set tb = {'apathy':['c-muted','apathy','清淡'],'normal':['c-info','normal','正常'],'active':['c-warn','active','活跃'],'mania':['c-down','mania','狂热']}[I.turnover.band] %}
    <div style="margin-bottom:8px">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px">
        <span class="bignum">¥{{ I.turnover.turnover_t }}{{ t('T', '万亿') }}</span>
        <span class="chip {{ tb[0] }}">{{ t(tb[1], tb[2]) }}</span>
      </div>
      <span class="sub">{{ t('two-market turnover (成交额)', '两市成交额') }} · {{ t('pctile', '分位') }} {{ I.turnover.pctile }}</span>
      <div class="chart">{{ I.turnover.chart_html | safe }}</div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    {% if I.flows and I.flows.ah %}
    <div style="margin-bottom:10px">
      <span class="bignum {{ 'neg' if I.flows.ah.level>=140 else '' }}">{{ I.flows.ah.level }}</span>
      <span class="sub">{{ t('AH premium', 'AH 溢价') }}{% if I.flows.ah.pctile is not none %} · {{ t('pctile', '分位') }} {{ I.flows.ah.pctile }}{% else %} · {{ t('building history', '历史积累中') }}{% endif %}</span>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    {% if I.flows.limit %}
    <div class="tiles" style="margin:0 0 6px">
      <div class="tile"><div class="tv pos">{{ I.flows.limit.zt }}</div><div class="tk">{{ t('limit-up 涨停', '涨停') }}</div></div>
      <div class="tile"><div class="tv neg">{{ I.flows.limit.dt }}</div><div class="tk">{{ t('limit-down 跌停', '跌停') }}</div></div>
      {% if I.flows.limit.seal_rate is not none %}<div class="tile"><div class="tv">{{ I.flows.limit.seal_rate }}%</div><div class="tk">{{ t('seal rate 封板率', '封板率') }}</div></div>{% endif %}
    </div>
    <p class="note" style="font-size:11px;margin:0">{{ t('as of', '截至') }} {{ I.flows.limit.date }} · {{ t('炸板', '炸板') }} {{ I.flows.limit.zb }}</p>
    {% endif %}
    {% if I.flows.etf %}
    <p class="note" style="margin:8px 0 0">{% if I.flows.etf.building %}{{ t('ETF flow: building (needs a 2nd daily snapshot)', 'ETF 资金流：积累中（需第二个每日快照）') }}{% else %}{{ t('ETF net creation', 'ETF 净申购') }}: <b class="{{ 'pos' if I.flows.etf.net_creation>=0 else 'neg' }}">{{ '{:+,d}'.format(I.flows.etf.net_creation) }}</b> {{ t('shares', '份') }} ({{ I.flows.etf.up }}↑/{{ I.flows.etf.down }}↓){% endif %}</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- MTF cards for the leaders -->
  <div class="panel span12">
    <h2>{{ t('Cycle Detail — Sector Leaders', '周期详情 — 领先板块') }}</h2>
    <div class="mtf-grid">
      {% for s in sectors[:6] %}
      <div class="mtf-card">
        <div class="mtf-name"><a href="sectors/{{ s.ticker }}.html">{{ td(s.name) }}</a> <span class="lad {{ 'up' if s.dir=='up' else ('down' if s.dir=='down' else 'flat') }}">{{ td(s.label or s.state) }}</span></div>
        <div class="mtf" data-mtf='{{ s.mtf_json }}'></div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ===================== REGIME LIFESPANS + DATA HEALTH ===================== -->
  {% if lifespan_rows %}
  <div class="panel span6">
    <h2>{{ t('Regime lifespans — base rates', '周期存续期 — 基准概率') }}
      {{ help("Every regime period since ~2006: how many there were, the median length, and the two most common next quads. China regimes are shorter and less stable than the US — context, not a forecast.", "自约 2006 年以来的每个周期时段：出现次数、存续期中位数，以及最常见的两个下一象限。中国周期比美国更短、更不稳定 — 仅作背景，而非预测。") }}
    </h2>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th class="l">{{ t('regime', '周期') }}</th><th>{{ t('periods', '次数') }}</th><th>{{ t('median days', '中位天数') }}</th><th class="l">{{ t('most common next', '最常见下一周期') }}</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
      {% for row in lifespan_rows %}
        <tr><td class="l">{{ td(row.name) }}</td><td>{{ row.n }}</td><td>{{ row.median }}</td><td class="l">{{ t(row.next, row.next_zh) }}</td></tr>
      {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% if health %}
  <div class="panel span6" id="data-health">
    <h2>{{ t('Data health', '数据健康度') }}
      {{ help("Freshness of the China data feeds powering this page. ‘ok’ = updated within its expected cadence; rows = total stored history.", "驱动本页的中国数据源的新鲜度。‘ok’＝在预期更新周期内已更新；rows＝累计存储行数。") }}
    </h2>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th class="l">{{ t('source', '来源') }}</th><th>{{ t('status', '状态') }}</th><th>{{ t('rows', '行数') }}</th><th>{{ t('last', '最新') }}</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
      {% for h in health %}
        <tr><td class="l">{{ t(h.en, h.zh) }}</td><td><span class="lad {{ 'up' if h.status=='ok' else ('warn' if h.status=='stale' else 'down') }}">{{ h.status }}</span></td><td>{{ '{:,}'.format(h.rows) }}</td><td>{{ h.last }}</td></tr>
      {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% endif %}{# /mode != stocks — macro group 2 (crowd meter, southbound, connect, PBoC, credit, sentiment, MTF, lifespans, data health) #}

</div>

<div class="foot">
  {{ t('Built', '生成于') }} {{ built }} ·
  {{ t('Free public data (yfinance + Eastmoney), mechanical &amp; backtested · not investment advice',
        '免费公开数据（yfinance + 东方财富），机械化并经回测 · 非投资建议') }}<br>
  {{ t('Sector ETFs ~5y history (display-grade RS); regime &amp; ladder calibrated on the deep 2006–2026 panel.',
        '板块ETF约5年历史（展示级相对强弱）；周期与阶梯基于2006–2026深度样本校准。') }}
</div>

<script>
window.__CHART_SWAP__ = {
  colors: {"#5fbf7f":"#e07070","#e07070":"#5fbf7f","#2e9e4f":"#d04545","#d04545":"#2e9e4f"},
  labels: {}
};
</script>
<script src="theme.js"></script>
<script src="chart_i18n.js"></script>
<script src="mtf.js"></script>
<script src="timemachine.js"></script>
<script src="tablesort.js"></script>
<script>
  // keep tooltips on-screen: flip below near the top of the viewport, and anchor to
  // the nearest side when the help icon is close to the left/right edge
  document.addEventListener('mouseover', function (e) {
    var h = e.target.closest('.help'); if (!h) return;
    var r = h.getBoundingClientRect();
    h.classList.toggle('below', r.top < 340);
    var tip = h.querySelector('.tip');
    var half = ((tip && tip.offsetWidth) || 300) / 2 + 16;
    h.classList.remove('edge-right', 'edge-left');
    if (r.left + r.width / 2 + half > window.innerWidth) h.classList.add('edge-right');
    else if (r.left + r.width / 2 - half < 0) h.classList.add('edge-left');
  });
</script>
</body>
</html>
